      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love these options. You can already mute the objects, why not allow me to make them not show, too?\n\nI feel, though, that they won't add these options. They want people to see these things and go \"Oh that's neat, let me throw some money their way to get them, too!\" Like how Ubisoft would purposefully matchmake people who had no cosmetics with people who did so that they would see them any maybe buy them. I sure hope we are better than that, here.",
