      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As fun as items and special effects can be, sometimes its just too much for me to handle. Loud sounds, particles and bright visuals. \n\nI usually have majority of players hidden because i don't want unexpected visuals or sounds to happen through avatar features. It would be nice to be able to do the same for items and effects as well.",
