      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Accessibility is always a wonderful thing. I think this would be a very good addition to the game.\n\n Being able to set them per rank in the SHIELD would also be very nice! \n\nWhenever this conversation comes up, people usually say that this is the way it is because money. But since you can turn off items and premium stickers in an instance this falls apart pretty quickly as a reason to not have this.\n\nExpanding on the already available SHIELD and safety settings is definitely the way to go!\n\n* An extra credit option would be a photo sensitivity mode that locally turns off all items, stickers, join/leave, and makes the portal a non flashy bare minimum variant. You guys have a similar set up for color blindness and I think this could be a good addition!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
