      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6a13d3e7b94d2b86707854be",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's 3 bigger groups it affects that it isn't toggleable\n\n1st of photosensitive people (lots of particles, bright lights etc)\n\nthere's no way to turn them off, safety bubble doesn't work on them sadly, and there's nothing els we can do. It would be big step towards making vrc a safe place for people with photonsensitive issues. \n\n2nd people with phobias, due to fire, bee's firework etc.\n\nThere's just so many phobias and while u can hide a person that wears a scarry avatar, avoid worlds like that. It's just getting pushed into ur face with items, emotes.\n\n3rd is people with weak computers (or phone users, questies etc)\n\nIf in a bigger world and multiple people using items and effects it can be very laggy.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-05-25T04:45:27.392Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There is currently no option to disable fancy portals.\n\nThere is currently no option to disable join/leave animations.\n\nThere is currently no option to disable items without being world host.\n\nHaving an option in safety settings would mitigate performance dips and be safer for users by giving users control of/ the ability to disable uncontrollable particles/ animations. For epileptic and photosensitive users, disabling items individually is tedious and problematic, some of us can not look at items to disable them without risking medical problems. The same can be said for fancy portals and join/ leave animations if people join/leave near you, we do not have control over placement. \n\nGive us an option to disable these in the safety settings.",
